WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.189
Four major arcana cards, from The Lovers to The Hermit, with
upright meanings, reversals and a tip for each.

00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:13.251
The Lovers stands for choice, values,
union and alignment.

00:00:14.551 --> 00:00:19.044
The Chariot stands for drive,
determination, direction and control.

00:00:20.344 --> 00:00:24.106
Strength stands for courage, patience,
compassion and inner strength.

00:00:25.406 --> 00:00:29.667
The Hermit stands for solitude,
reflection, guidance and inner search.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:33.506
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:33.506 --> 00:00:38.451
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
